WEBVTT

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:32.200
Driger!

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:36.270
Hiromi says she wants
to see a Sacred Beast.

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:38.950
Takao and the guys thought
it'd be impossible, but

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:46.260
Hiromi was able to see the moves of Yusuf's
Sacred Beast, after challenging Rei to a battle.

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:48.980
Which opened up Rei and
Byakko's path to victory!

00:01:49.570 --> 00:01:55.300
I'm sure Hiromi's desire for
Byakko to win got through to it!

00:01:56.110 --> 00:01:57.500
Above you!

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:25.230
Digital Dragon and
Digital Bird are taking form.

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:46.410
Well, Mr. Gideon?

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:49.410
Okay, that's enough.

00:02:59.230 --> 00:03:04.800
And now I would like for you
to think of them as complete.

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:07.880
This time they won't go
berserk again, will they?

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:09.790
You needn't be concerned.

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:14.130
All that's left is to find
a Blader fit to wield it.

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:15.460
A Blader?

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:18.810
We need a Blader equivalent
to the BBA team--

00:03:18.810 --> 00:03:24.180
no, a Blader with spirit and
technique that surpasses theirs.

00:03:24.520 --> 00:03:26.840
You have someone in
mind, I presume?

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:30.300
Yes. You will meet him soon.

00:03:30.300 --> 00:03:32.210
I look forward to it.

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:41.030
Let's do it, Kai!

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:41.880
Come on!

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:42.950
Three!

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:44.640
Two! One!

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:46.500
Go, Shoot!

00:03:58.440 --> 00:04:01.200
The way Kai's Dranzer
moves has changed!

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:04.590
His speed and attack
have really sharpened up.

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:06.180
Just as planned!

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:13.430
Compared to before, this new Dranzer has
increased the balance of its speed and attack!

00:04:13.430 --> 00:04:15.720
It's called Dranzer Volcano!

00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:18.000
--Dranzer Volcano?
--Dranzer Volcano?

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:31.620
That's not fair, Kyoujyu.
Making a new Bey just for Kai...

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:38.930
Don't complain. Dranzer sustained quite a
bit of damage in its last battle with Dunga!

00:04:38.930 --> 00:04:43.320
It couldn't unleash its full power like
that, so I worked hard to upgrade it!

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:44.430
Quiet!

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:47.500
I can't concentrate!

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:50.000
Go, Dragoon!

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:52.180
Dranzer!

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:55.200
Look out!

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:56.210
Takao!

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:57.590
What the--?

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:02.520
Kai!

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:05.830
Who's there?

00:05:08.900 --> 00:05:10.010
It's you.

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:13.380
Good to see you again, Kai.

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:20.350
I apologize, that was rude.

00:05:20.350 --> 00:05:24.610
After seeing Dranzer battle,
I just couldn't help myself.

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:27.890
My name is Yuya Minami.

00:05:28.150 --> 00:05:31.890
I'm Kai's classmate and he's been
a great help to me in the dorms.

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:33.390
A friend, then?

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:35.990
Don't scare us like that. Honestly...

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:41.240
I knew you'd be with
your BBA teammates, Kai.

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:46.480
I've been dying to see you.

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:50.980
But after I stole
Dranzer and battled,

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:54.000
I figured you
wouldn't forgive me.

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:55.700
And, well...

00:05:57.820 --> 00:05:58.610
Shoot!

00:05:58.610 --> 00:05:59.600
Shoot!!

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:03.010
What?!

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:20.410
From that day
onward, you left us.

00:06:23.140 --> 00:06:27.300
Kai! I want to become
strong, just like you.

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:30.910
Which is why I started going
to Blader development classes.

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:34.610
And I've kept up
with the training...

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:37.110
But I'm missing something.

00:06:37.850 --> 00:06:41.000
Will you train me?

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:46.710
My dream is to battle
against you, one on one.

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:49.220
I can keep working hard
because I have that dream!

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:50.900
No...

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:54.630
It's the only thing
that keeps me going!

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:56.870
I know it's a selfish request.

00:06:56.870 --> 00:06:58.240
But please...

00:06:58.240 --> 00:06:59.130
No.

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:01.040
Leave.

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:02.840
But why?

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:05.540
I can take any training
you throw at me.

00:07:05.890 --> 00:07:10.000
I will work as hard as I can to
become an amazing Blader like you!

00:07:10.230 --> 00:07:11.860
Even if I can't...

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:14.250
I want to get even
a little bit closer!

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:15.400
Please!

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:19.210
Kai!

00:07:22.570 --> 00:07:24.190
I'm sorry.

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:26.500
But I'm not giving up.

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:29.760
Someday, I will battle you. And win!

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:31.940
You will never defeat me.

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:35.910
Goodbye.

00:07:43.090 --> 00:07:44.580
Are you sure about this, Kai?

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:46.880
To just turn him
down like that...

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:51.620
That Yuya kid wants
to improve, right?

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:53.330
I thought Kai
would understand...

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:55.940
He understands, which is
why he's tough on him.

00:07:57.180 --> 00:08:00.580
Kai used to have a desire for
strength than anyone else did.

00:08:01.090 --> 00:08:03.600
I'm sure Kai saw
his old self in him.

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:04.900
Kai...

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:12.290
Those scientists completed
the digital Sacred Beasts?

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:13.360
Yeah.

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:16.870
They've been doing a
load of weird experiments,

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:18.690
so I went to
satisfy my curiosity.

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:20.670
There's no mistaking it.

00:08:20.670 --> 00:08:25.410
They're in a frenzy to find Bladers
who can wield their Sacred Beasts.

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:29.720
Knowing them...

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:34.000
Once they find a Blader, they'll use them to attack Kinomiya's team.

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:36.240
Which means we
need to make a move.

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:37.460
Probably...

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:39.160
Either way,

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:42.510
we can't let those scientists
take the four Sacred Beasts.

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:53.410
Kai...

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:54.960
Darn it!

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:57.060
Minami. You've got guests.

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:04.210
You're giving me a new Bey?

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:08.210
Indeed. We took a look
at your ability data

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:11.840
and you're a perfect fit for
the new Bey we developed.

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:14.300
Well? Would you like to try it?

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:19.380
I would be honored.
With pleasure!

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:30.170
Don't worry. It's safe.

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:33.540
First, take a look at
the Bey you'll be using.

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:40.930
Three! Two! One!

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:42.560
Go, Shoot!

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:47.830
Wow...

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:50.100
Energy has reached
the critical point.

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:00.880
That's a Sacred Beast.

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:02.690
A digital Sacred Beast.

00:10:02.690 --> 00:10:05.040
A digital... Sacred Beast...

00:10:08.950 --> 00:10:10.910
I don't blame you
for being surprised.

00:10:11.180 --> 00:10:15.780
It may sound ridiculous, but a Bey with a Sacred Beast within it can output tens--

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:19.300
no, hundreds of times the
power of a typical Bey.

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:22.150
R-really?

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:26.400
A Sacred Beast can bring about
unfathomable power from a Bey.

00:10:26.740 --> 00:10:32.240
Something like this is also in the Beys
of the world champions, the BBA team.

00:10:47.850 --> 00:10:53.400
And I'd like for you to battle against one
of the four members of the BBA team.

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:56.180
Against Kai Hiwatari.

00:10:57.900 --> 00:10:58.920
Kai...

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:02.950
If you can get used to a Sacred Beast,
you can command it as you wish.

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:06.550
According to our data, you
should be able to handle it.

00:11:06.840 --> 00:11:09.400
I'm going to...
battle Kai...

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:15.380
And you'll undergo training
under our wing from now on. Yes?

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:19.280
Yes!

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:30.240
You will never defeat me.

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:32.380
I'll do it.

00:11:32.380 --> 00:11:36.170
Fighting him and beating him are the
only ways for Kai to acknowledge me.

00:11:36.720 --> 00:11:38.360
I'll show you, Kai!

00:11:38.360 --> 00:11:40.850
I'll show you
how strong I am!

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:50.890
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:11:54.660 --> 00:11:59.400
The training is rigorous, but that
young man Yuya is doing well.

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:02.550
He has entered the
first step of training.

00:12:02.550 --> 00:12:05.870
Once he's ready, he
will go face Hiwatari.

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:08.320
Failure is not an option.

00:12:08.320 --> 00:12:09.060
Sir!

00:12:09.060 --> 00:12:11.200
I'm home!

00:12:11.570 --> 00:12:13.790
Welcome home, Kinomiya.

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:14.630
What?!

00:12:15.680 --> 00:12:16.820
Ozma!

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:19.920
You wanna battle again?

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:21.040
Don't get hasty!

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:24.820
I'm here to give you a warning.

00:12:24.820 --> 00:12:26.210
A warning?

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:27.760
About those scientists.

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:30.750
They will send a new
Blader to challenge you.

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:33.010
But don't fight them.

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:38.230
Their goal is to take your Sacred
Beasts away using their digital ones.

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:40.610
Digital Sacred Beasts?

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:42.730
You mean the copied ones, right?

00:12:42.730 --> 00:12:44.870
But that one went berserk, and...

00:12:44.870 --> 00:12:48.560
The digital Sacred Beasts aren't as incomplete as that one was.

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:53.330
Thanks for the heads-up, Ozma.
But I can't follow your advice.

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:58.530
We accept any
challenge thrown at us!

00:12:58.530 --> 00:13:00.490
He's right.

00:13:00.490 --> 00:13:04.390
We don't run or hide.
That's how the BBA team fights.

00:13:04.570 --> 00:13:07.200
I don't care what those
digital Sacred Beasts are.

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:11.410
My Dragoon will take
care of those fakers!

00:13:11.710 --> 00:13:13.410
How confident.

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:16.910
Don't let your guard down. Underestimate
them and you'll be in for a world of hurt.

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:18.670
Ozma, wait!

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:21.460
I have something to ask you.

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:24.490
Are you with us or against us?

00:13:26.880 --> 00:13:28.720
Hey! Answer me!

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:30.810
I don't like this...

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:13.490
Kai's really into it...

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:18.200
He'll hurt himself if he keeps
training without stopping to eat.

00:14:18.630 --> 00:14:21.110
Kai! You should take a break!

00:14:24.720 --> 00:14:26.410
We saw him earlier...

00:14:26.690 --> 00:14:27.710
Yuya?

00:14:27.710 --> 00:14:29.060
That outfit...

00:14:29.060 --> 00:14:32.080
It's the same as that Psykick
Blader from the other day!

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:33.500
Which means...!

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:35.190
Ozma was right?!

00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:38.820
He's the Blader Psykick sent after us?

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:40.740
He's mine!

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:41.800
Stay out of this!

00:14:45.810 --> 00:14:48.880
Kai. I came to beat you.

00:14:49.230 --> 00:14:50.920
I refuse to fight you.

00:14:50.920 --> 00:14:52.410
I'll make you.

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:55.120
Against my Sacred Beast, Digital Bird.

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:56.420
Digital Bird?

00:14:56.420 --> 00:14:57.270
You fool...

00:14:57.270 --> 00:15:00.980
What's the matter?
Are you scared of me?

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:04.320
Kai, just what is...

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:05.850
Hold it right there!

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:10.260
I won't let you!

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:11.300
I remember you!

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:13.060
Lookin' good, kiddo!

00:15:13.060 --> 00:15:15.780
But Kai Hiwatari fights me!

00:15:15.780 --> 00:15:17.650
Step the hell back!

00:15:17.650 --> 00:15:20.500
Sounds like you want to
become food for my Digital Bird.

00:15:22.530 --> 00:15:26.380
I'm gonna chew you
up and spit you out!

00:15:26.380 --> 00:15:28.620
Just one moment, Kai.

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:31.010
We'll battle after I
take care of him.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:38.890
Interrupted again...

00:15:39.020 --> 00:15:41.190
Damn that guy, butting in...

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:43.810
Pay attention, Kai.

00:15:43.810 --> 00:15:46.750
I'm not the same
person I used to be!

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:49.300
Let's do it! Three!

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:50.190
Two!

00:15:50.370 --> 00:15:51.290
--One!

00:15:51.490 --> 00:15:54.710
--Go, Shoot!

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:57.510
What's going on?

00:15:57.850 --> 00:16:00.300
Why's your classmate with Psykick?

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:04.720
What's the matter?
Those are some simple attacks.

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:06.000
What'd you say?

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:08.100
Go, Voltic Ape!

00:16:14.060 --> 00:16:15.950
Keep your head cool, Dunga!

00:16:16.230 --> 00:16:18.770
Yeah! Play it cool!

00:16:19.060 --> 00:16:21.460
I don't think telling him
that will do any good!

00:16:26.270 --> 00:16:27.780
Time to go.

00:16:29.810 --> 00:16:30.890
Damn!

00:16:30.890 --> 00:16:32.410
Those moves!

00:16:32.410 --> 00:16:36.980
Ozma was right.
We can't underestimate them!

00:16:39.050 --> 00:16:41.990
What happened to you?

00:16:42.610 --> 00:16:44.120
Well?

00:16:44.510 --> 00:16:48.150
You beat me good before
but this is all you got?

00:16:49.030 --> 00:16:50.460
What a let down.

00:16:50.680 --> 00:16:53.890
Digital Bird, blow him away!

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:04.620
Digital Bird has taken form.

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:10.010
He summoned the Sacred Beast...

00:17:10.010 --> 00:17:13.790
Don't hold back, now!
Crush him, Digital Bird!

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:24.580
What?!

00:17:24.930 --> 00:17:26.270
Shockwaves!

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:28.650
They're emitting from Digital Bird!

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:30.800
I didn't know a Sacred
Beast could be so powerful!

00:17:38.440 --> 00:17:40.320
What's wrong with Dunga?

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:43.380
Digital Bird...

00:17:44.180 --> 00:17:46.400
It's getting stronger!

00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:49.490
Digital Bird is powering up!

00:17:50.680 --> 00:17:55.460
I can't believe it. The Sacred Beast itself is strengthening mid-battle...

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:05.400
Digital Bird is getting
stronger than before!

00:18:06.320 --> 00:18:07.830
Hey, he's...

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:12.500
What's wrong?

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:16.770
The digital Sacred Beast's sudden shift is having an adverse effect on the Blader,

00:18:16.770 --> 00:18:19.060
and he can't handle the burden!

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:20.880
Darn.

00:18:21.010 --> 00:18:22.980
Kai would be able...

00:18:23.810 --> 00:18:25.770
to stop something like this...

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:30.210
Digital Bird!

00:18:34.310 --> 00:18:35.310
Kai...

00:18:36.820 --> 00:18:39.940
You're just being
used by Psykick!

00:18:39.940 --> 00:18:41.700
Why can't you see that?

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:43.980
I...

00:18:43.980 --> 00:18:45.740
I want to become strong!

00:18:45.740 --> 00:18:47.200
Just like you!

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:52.240
His body and mind
can't keep this up!

00:18:53.380 --> 00:18:54.980
Stop this!

00:18:59.220 --> 00:19:00.280
Kai!

00:19:10.970 --> 00:19:14.400
Run wild! Bite right into him! Digital Bird!

00:19:15.140 --> 00:19:16.300
No way...

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:22.510
You're the strongest Sacred Beast in the world! No, of all time!

00:19:24.900 --> 00:19:26.390
End this!

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:36.770
Dunga!

00:19:38.050 --> 00:19:39.660
It blew him back!

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:46.820
It did it! It won!

00:19:46.820 --> 00:19:49.110
Digital Bird won!

00:19:49.360 --> 00:19:51.120
Doctor, Yuya's condition...

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:53.080
What?

00:20:00.780 --> 00:20:02.530
No... No...

00:20:02.530 --> 00:20:04.500
I don't want to fight anymore.

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:06.630
I can't fight.

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:09.630
Are you okay?

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:12.020
Yuya!

00:20:14.120 --> 00:20:15.100
Yuya!!

00:20:28.230 --> 00:20:29.080
Got it.

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:31.990
We recovered the
digital Sacred Beast, but

00:20:31.990 --> 00:20:33.570
that young man...

00:20:33.570 --> 00:20:36.480
He's of no use to us. Come back.

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:37.360
Roger that.

00:20:41.060 --> 00:20:44.840
I believe that the digital
Sacred Beast chooses the Blader...

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:48.990
Arrange for a replacement Blader.

00:20:48.990 --> 00:20:49.670
Yes, sir!

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:57.100
Kinomiya. Don't forget my warning.

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:03.300
Kai...

00:21:08.640 --> 00:21:10.420
Why did this...

00:21:10.420 --> 00:21:14.500
The digital Sacred Beast
strengthened in the midst of battle

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:19.010
and delivers a horrible
shock to the user...

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:21.390
That much we can be sure of.

00:21:22.450 --> 00:21:23.410
Kai.

00:21:25.740 --> 00:21:27.160
I will...

00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:29.350
Never forgive them!

00:22:59.820 --> 00:23:02.280
After seeing the power
of the digital Sacred Beast,

00:23:02.280 --> 00:23:05.440
Takao and the others start to panic.

00:23:05.440 --> 00:23:09.260
We try to give support but we start to fight, so what should we do?

00:23:09.260 --> 00:23:11.810
At this rate, the BBA team will be over with!

00:23:11.810 --> 00:23:15.690
Huh? "It's time to get the band back together?"

00:23:15.690 --> 00:23:18.150
Chairman, we're not some pop group!

00:23:18.150 --> 00:23:20.980
Save the puns for later, and
watch the next episode, okay?
